---
/**
 * Scientific graticule grid per §4.5:
 * 1px lines at 22% opacity, 96px cells, masked by a radial gradient.
 * Never exceeds 22% opacity over text.
 */
---
<div class="pointer-events-none fixed inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="graticule-grid absolute inset-0"></div>
</div>
